<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.85 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.85 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 5.85 percent in the week ending June 14 from 5.83 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICES  June 14, 1997  June 7, 1997 June 15, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change   +5.85	    +5.83	   +4.40</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  323.8	    323.2	   305.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended June 15, 1996</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
